From: Andreas Baierl <ichgeh@imkreisrum.de>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 13:17:39 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 21/34] Filter DSM-CC stream events

HbbTV applications use stream events (do-it-now) for actions synced
to the programme. Collect the component tags of the PMT, filter the
DSM-CC stream descriptor sections of the requested components and
send the stream events to the browser.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5
